WEBVTT

00:12:59.197 --> 00:13:01.263
This time there was no begging.

00:13:02.297 --> 00:13:05.230
He said, "The cancer
is growing really fast."

00:13:07.063 --> 00:13:10.163
She looked at him in the eye
and said, "I know."

00:13:14.063 --> 00:13:15.230
Two days later,

00:13:15.263 --> 00:13:17.763
she got her two signatures
and signed legal documents

00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:20.797
and prescription to proceed
with Death With Dignity.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.863
The fight was over and she won.

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:26.430
It was actually one
of the happiest days of her life.

00:13:28.363 --> 00:13:29.997
I want to be clear and say